    {
      "title": "Calderan_Restoration_Party",
      "categories": [
        "Political_parties",
        "Caldera"
      ],
      "snippet": "{{Infobox political party\n| name = Calderan Restoration Party\n| native_name = \n| native_name_lang = \n| logo = File:VolinTriband.webp\n| colorcode = #FFD000\n| leader = William Derekson\n| ideology = Liberalism\n| foundation = {{Start date|2035|12|08}}\n| headquarters = 230 Eastern Avenue North, [[Neu Maessen]], [[Calderan Republic|Caldera]]\n| country = [[Calderan Republic]]\n| colours = {{plainlist|\n* {{color box|#312AB4|border=darkgray}} Blue {{color box|#FFD000|border=darkgray}} Yellow\n| }}\n| membership = \n}}\n\nThe '''Calderan Restoration Party''' (Gothic: ''Ceulde Restaurierungspartei'', [[Daxia|Daxian]]: ''卡尔德兰恢复党''), sometimes abbreviated as '''CRP''', is one of 4 major political parties in the [[Calderan Republic]]. Their main opposition is the [[Calderan Unity Party]]. \n\nThe CRP's political beliefs mainly surround the reframing of Calderan culture to be more similar to the [[Fascist Caldera|State of Austro-Caldera]], but notably not as a dictatorship as promoted by the [[Volkspartei]]. \n\n== Name ==\nThe term \"restoration\" being used in the name of the party refers to the 'restoration of the original Calderan spirit', described by party founder William Derekson as being his ultimate goal in Calderan government.\n\n== Party structure ==\nThe Restoration Council is the organization in charge of promoting PRC ideology and campaign activities. The Council also determines membership in the party, as politicians must request membership and the council must accept it. People who are not "
    },
    {
      "title": "Calderan_Unity_Party",
      "categories": [
        "Political_parties",
        "Caldera"
      ],
      "snippet": "{{Infobox political party\n| name = Calderan Unity Party\n| native_name = Parti de la Unite Qalderano\n| native_name_lang = \n| logo = File:Naval_ensign_of_Russia.svg\n| colorcode = #000000\n| leader = [[Charles LeMieux]]\n| ideology = Populism<br>Conservatism\n| foundation = {{Start date|2037|02|04}}\n| headquarters = 115 Seuber Street, [[Little Caldera]], [[Calderan Republic|Caldera]]\n| country = [[Calderan Republic]]\n| colours = {{color box|#000099|border=darkgray}} Blue {{color box|#FFFFFF|border=darkgray}} White <br>{{color box|#000000|border=darkgray}} Black (when neither blue nor white are available)\n| membership = \n}}\n\nThe '''Calderan Unity Party''' ([[Kench language|Kench]]: Parti de la Unite Qalderano), sometimes abbreviated as '''CUP''' or '''PUQ''', is one of 4 major political parties in the [[Calderan Republic]]. Their main opposition is the [[Calderan Restoration Party]].\n\nThe CUP's political beliefs mainly surround the reframing of Calderan culture to be more internationally distinct, and to not derive any of its culture from [[Levantia|Levantine]] sources. As part of this, CUP is the biggest political advocate for the widespread usage of the Kench language, argued by many to be the only 'truly Calderan language', as [[Volin language|Volin]] is often discredited for its association with [[Indigeno-Calderan]] ethnic groups.\n\n== Name ==\nThe party uses the term \"unity\" to refer to its main goal in government, as they intend to \"unify\" all of Caldera into a singular Caldera"
    },
