      "title": "Volkspartei",
      "categories": [
        "Political_parties",
        "Caldera"
      ],
      "snippet": "The '''Volkspartei''' (Gothic: People's Party) was the national political party of [[Fascist Caldera|Caldera]] from 1600 until 2034. They were the only political party allowed to run for Prime Leader, and because of this, the Volkspartei is considered to be one of the oldest active political parties in the world. The Volkspartei is controversial for only allowing people of Gothic descent into their membership, and for being the cause of several revolts and civil unrest in Caldera.\n\n{{Infobox political party\n| name = People's Party\n| native_name = Volkspartei\n| native_name_lang = de\n| logo = VolksparteiDefense.png\n| colorcode = #353D86\n| leader = Karl Steinenkatz\n| ideology = Gothic Nationalism\n| foundation = {{Start date|1600|02|16}}\n| headquarters = [[Little Caldera]], [[Calderan Republic|Caldera]]\n| country = [[Calderan Republic]]\n| colours = {{plainlist|\n* {{color box|#353D86|border=darkgray}} Blue {{color box|#DE0000|border=darkgray}} Red\n| }}\n| membership = 425 (2030)\n}}\n\n== Name ==\nWhen the political party was first created, several names were considered, including \"The Gothic Party\", \"True Party\", \"Good Party\", \"Calderan National Party\", and \"Gothic People's Prime Leader Party\". It was decided that the new party would simply be called the \"People's Party\", in order to include all people of Gothic origin, and to encourage [[Indigeno-Calderan]] people that the party represents them in a way.\n\n== History ==\n\n=== Founding (1600) ===\nWhen Caldera was first settled by Gothic"
