      ],
      "snippet": "{{wip}}\n\n{{Infobox military unit\n| unit_name                     = League of Nations Command\n| image                         = LoNFlag.png\n| caption                       = LoNC\n| dates                         = 3 March 2022 – 31 March 2027\n| country                       = {{flag|League of Nations}}\n| allegiance                    = \n| battles                       = [[Final War of the Deluge]]\n| website                       = \n| commander1                    = {{flagicon|Urcea}} [[Ranks_in_the_Urcean_Armed_Forces|LEC PRI]] [[Martin St. Clair]]\n| commander1_label              = Supreme Allied Commander Varshan\n| commander2                    = {{flagicon|Cartadania}} GEN Oliver F. Tudela\n| commander2_label              = Deputy Allied Commander Varshan\n| commander3                    = \n| commander3_label              = \n| notable_commanders            = \n| countries                     = {{flag|Urcea}}<br>{{flag|Alstin}}<br>{{flag|Cartadania}}<br>{{flag|Nahe}}<br>{{flag|The Cape}}\n}}\n\n'''League of Nations Command''' ('''LoNC''' or '''League Command''') was the multinational military force that fought in the [[Final War of the Deluge]] against [[Varshan]]. It was the first international unified command in history, and the first attempt at collective security pursuant to the [[Code of the League of Nations|Charter of the League of Nations]].\n\nLoNC was established on 3 March 2022 following the [[Atomic bombing of Zakan Rot]] and subsequent action taken by the [[League of Nati"
