      "snippet": "{{wip}}\n{{Infobox legislature\n| background_color  = \n| name              = League of Nations General Assembly\n| legislature       = \n| coa_pic           = \n| coa_res           =\n| coa_alt           = \n| coa_caption       = \n| logo_pic          = Longen.png\n| logo_res          =\n| logo_alt          = Flag of the LoN General Assembly\n| logo_caption      = Flag of the LoN General Assembly\n| house_type        = International congress\n| body              = League of Nations\n| term_limits       = None\n| new_session       = \n\n| leader1_type      = [[Provost-General of the League of Nations|Provost General]]\n| leader1           = [[Shang Tsung]]\n| party1            = \n| election1         = \n\n| members           = Member states of the [[League of Nations]]\n| structure1        = \n| structure1_res    =\n| political_groups1 = \n| term_length       = 1 year\n| voting_system1    = \n|title=\n| session_room      = Bundesarchiv B 145 Bild-F023908-0002, Straßburg, Tagung des Europarates.jpg\n| session_res       =\n| session_alt       =\n| meeting_place     = Hall of States, Palace of Nations, [[Alba Concordia]]\n| website           = \n}}\n\nThe '''League of Nations General Assembly''' ('''LoNGA''' or '''GA''') is one of four primary parts of the [[League of Nations]], serving as the main deliberative, policy-making, and representative organ of the League of Nations. The General Assembly is the main deliberative assembly of the body. Composed of all League member states, the assembly meets in regular mon"
