      "snippet": "{{Infobox political party\n| name = Workers Party of Argyrea\n| logo = Ceremonialflag.webp\n| chairperson = [[Zoe Alafouzos]]\n| secretary = Boris Helmar\n| ideology = Bolshevism,\nCommunism,\nAnti-Capitalism,\nAnti-Zionism,\nProletarian Feminism,\nAnti-Deviationism,\n| international = International Workers Party\n| website = workingclasswar.arg\n| country = De Jure international, de facto Argyrea\n| foundation = 9th of December, 1912\n}}\n\nThe '''Workers Party of Argyrea''' is the Argyrean section of the Bolshevist International, better known in the modern era as the [[International Workers Party]]. Founded in Argyreopolis at the Wretched Excess Bar by [[Dawud Bolshevi]], [[Olivier Anargyros]], [[Ioannis Almidfaye]], among 40 other party constitution signatories, the Workers Party has endured for over a hundred years as the largest orthodox Livasist party in the world, including supporters outside of Argyrea. The Workers Party of Argyrea led the United Front for Permanent Revolution against Pharaoh [[Casimir V]], overthrowing the Empire of Argyrea Outremer and establishing the Workers State of [[Argyrea]], the last officially one party Livasist state in the world. From the start, the Workers Party was able to was a pioneer i. supporting womens rights ,gay rights, and transgender rights, but in the 1950s the chairwoman [[Emma Abravranel]] made Feminism, specifically [[Bolshevist Feminism]] the core ideology of the party. Unlike the anti-Bolshevist Livasist states that were prominent before t"
